            "description": "<p>Most bridal gowns, designer gowns, and many accessories sold by The Fall Bride are manufactured specifically for the customer after an order is placed.</p><p>Special-order merchandise may include:</p><ul><li>Bridal gowns<br/></li><li>Veils<br/></li><li>Accessories<br/></li><li>Customizations<br/></li><li>Designer-made items<br/></li><li>Trunk show purchases<br/></li><li>Rush orders<br/></li></ul><p>Production timelines are estimates only.</p><p>We are not responsible for delays caused by:</p><ul><li>Manufacturers<br/></li><li>Shipping carriers<br/></li><li>Customs processing<br/></li><li>Supply chain disruptions<br/></li><li>Force majeure events<br/></li></ul><p>Estimated delivery dates are not guaranteed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "terms_item_kVqnYT": {
          "type": "terms_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Final Sale Policy",
            "description": "<p>ALL SALES ARE FINAL UNLESS OTHERWISE REQUIRED BY LAW.</p><p>Due to the custom, made-to-order, and special-order nature of bridal merchandise, the following items are non-returnable, non-refundable, and non-exchangeable:</p><ul><li>Bridal gowns<br/></li><li>Special-order and made-to-order merchandise<br/></li><li>Customized items<br/><br/></li><li>Veils<br/></li><li>Accessories<br/></li><li>Jewelry<br/></li><li>Sale items<br/></li><li>Trunk show purchases<br/></li><li>Rush-order items<br/></li></ul><p>Once an order has been submitted to a designer or manufacturer, it cannot be canceled.</p><p>Deposits and payments are non-refundable.</p><p>Customers are solely responsible for reviewing and approving:</p><ul><li>Style selection<br/></li><li>Designer<br/></li><li>Size ordered<br/></li><li>Measurements<br/></li><li>Fabric choices<br/></li><li>Color selections<br/></li><li>Customization requests<br/></li></ul><p>No refunds, exchanges, credits, or cancellations will be granted due to changes in wedding date, venue, personal preference, body measurements, relationship status, or other circumstances outside our control.</p>"
          }
        },
        "terms_item_7JqAp4": {
          "type": "terms_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Measurements and Sizing",
            "description": "<p>Bridal sizing differs from standard retail sizing.</p><p>Measurements are used solely to recommend an appropriate manufacturer size.</p><p>We do not guarantee fit.</p><p>Weight changes, body changes, pregnancy, fitness programs, or personal alterations may affect fit after delivery.</p><p>Alterations are generally required for most bridal garments.</p>"
